
# 📚 Azure Reference Documentation & Learning Resources

This section provides additional reference material for understanding,
creating, configuring, and managing the Azure resources used by FlavorForge.

FlavorForge uses Microsoft Azure for its cloud infrastructure, including:

- Azure Resource Group
- Azure Container Registry (ACR)
- Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS)
- Azure CLI

These resources are provided for readers who want to understand Azure beyond
the project-specific implementation.

> **Recommended approach:** Start with the official Microsoft Azure
> documentation and Microsoft Learn modules, then use the videos and tutorials
> for additional practical understanding.

---

