# 3. Azure Architecture and Resource Management

Azure Resource Manager (ARM) provides the management layer for Azure resources.

[Azure Resource Manager Documentation](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-resource-manager/)

Conceptually:

```text
Azure Subscription
        |
        +----------------------+
        |                      |
        v                      v
 Resource Group          Resource Group
        |
        +----------------------------+
        |             |              |
        v             v              v
       ACR           AKS          Other Resources
